Package: withinpatient
Title: Within-Patient Evaluation of Repeated Binary Forecasts
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: person("Wesley", "Remy", email = "wesley.j.remy@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0007-6431-4200", affiliation = "Department of Computer Science, ETH Zurich"))
Description: Computes pooled, per-patient, and per-time-point discrimination,
    retrospective and moment-corrected rate benchmarks, calibration-in-the-large,
    Brier scores and skill against patient-specific references, exact conditional
    calibration slopes, and patient-wise permutation evaluation for repeated
    binary forecasts.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    stats
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
